WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:04.175
(high pitched sneeze)

00:00:04.893 --> 00:00:06.488
- What was that?

00:00:06.488 --> 00:00:08.442
- I don't know but it
sounded like a hamster dying.

00:00:08.442 --> 00:00:10.369
- Or a goldfish's orgasm.

00:00:10.369 --> 00:00:12.779
(high pitched sneeze)

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:18.055
- Anna, you feeling okay?

00:00:18.055 --> 00:00:20.277
- I feel grea- (sneeze)

00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:24.302
Great.

00:00:24.307 --> 00:00:26.258
- Hey, Anna if you're sick,
you should go home and rest.

00:00:26.258 --> 00:00:28.371
- I know. I'm not sick though.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.485
- Anna there's no shame in being sick.

00:00:33.485 --> 00:00:35.250
Technically I've never not been sick.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.131
Doctors consider me legally dead.

00:00:37.131 --> 00:00:38.408
- That's why you stay so trim.

00:00:38.408 --> 00:00:39.894
- Yeah I'm dangerously frail.

00:00:39.894 --> 00:00:41.519
- It's, um, just allergies.

00:00:41.519 --> 00:00:43.872
(coughing)

00:00:43.872 --> 00:00:45.892
- Anna if you're sick, the best place

00:00:45.892 --> 00:00:47.649
for you to be is home, in bed.

00:00:47.649 --> 00:00:49.478
- I can power through.

00:00:50.508 --> 00:00:53.629
(Hacking)

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:56.838
- Oh God! Enough Anna. You're
gonna get all of us sick.

00:00:56.838 --> 00:00:59.677
- No I had head lice last
February, no one even noticed.

00:00:59.677 --> 00:01:01.133
- That was you?

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:03.339
- I had to burn most of my clothes.

00:01:06.178 --> 00:01:08.383
- I can't take a sick day, okay?

00:01:08.383 --> 00:01:10.393
I already scheduled all
my sick days this year.

00:01:10.393 --> 00:01:11.836
- How do you know when
you're gonna be sick?

00:01:11.836 --> 00:01:13.113
- Is it crystals?

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:16.363
I, you know, my wife's into
like the salty air and stuff.

00:01:16.363 --> 00:01:18.616
- I don't know when I'm going to get sick.

00:01:18.616 --> 00:01:21.263
I work when I'm actually sick so I can use

00:01:21.263 --> 00:01:23.677
my sick days as extra vacation days.

00:01:23.677 --> 00:01:25.790
I'm gonna be coming down
with the flu next month

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:28.530
so I can go wine tasting
and Trench foot in September

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:30.225
so I can see DJ Mouse Meat in Vegas.

00:01:30.225 --> 00:01:32.524
- I love DJ Mouse Meat.
I'm a Mouse Meathead.

00:01:32.524 --> 00:01:34.706
- I know it's wrong. I'm sorry.

00:01:34.706 --> 00:01:36.494
- Anna. Everyone does that.

00:01:36.494 --> 00:01:38.700
You really think I have walking polio?

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:40.302
- Yeah, remember when I had pneumonia?

00:01:40.302 --> 00:01:43.230
I was kite surfing in Cabo with my wife.

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:45.643
I've actually never been
sick a day in my life.

00:01:45.643 --> 00:01:47.546
I have the immune system of a cat.

00:01:47.546 --> 00:01:50.147
- Did you know feline AIDS
affects 5 percent of all cats?

00:01:50.147 --> 00:01:52.539
It's an epidemic.
Nobody's talking about it.

00:01:52.539 --> 00:01:54.396
- What Elliot's trying
to say, is that it's okay

00:01:54.396 --> 00:01:56.091
to take a sick day when
you're actually sick.

00:01:56.091 --> 00:01:58.599
- You're right. You're right.

00:01:58.599 --> 00:02:02.012
I'll go home. I can just log out.

00:02:02.012 --> 00:02:04.775
- No Anna, it's okay. Get in bed.

00:02:04.775 --> 00:02:07.631
We'll cover you. It's not a big deal.

00:02:07.631 --> 00:02:10.345
- Really? Thanks guys.

00:02:11.755 --> 00:02:13.374
- Five percent guys.

00:02:13.374 --> 00:02:14.302
(cough)

00:02:14.302 --> 00:02:16.346
That's one in every twenty cats.

00:02:16.346 --> 00:02:19.144
Mr. Harris is at risk. He's
a very promiscuous cat.

00:02:20.444 --> 00:02:23.327
- Hey Sarah it's me. Yeah
of course they bought it.

00:02:23.327 --> 00:02:25.904
Alright. I will see you
in like twenty minutes.

00:02:25.904 --> 00:02:28.574
You are going to love the
new bikini top I bought.

00:02:28.574 --> 00:02:30.710
Okay. Alright. Bye!

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:33.488
A woo hoo.

00:02:33.488 --> 00:02:36.179
(Car starts)

00:02:42.597 --> 00:02:44.421
Anna you missed.

00:02:44.421 --> 00:02:46.621
Get it in the basket at least!

00:02:46.974 --> 00:02:49.244
Gross. Germs.

00:02:50.643 --> 00:02:52.681
Come on!

